  </div>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Chizuru Sales - Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    <p>Siga no Instagram: <a href="https://instagram.com/chizuru.sales" target="_blank">@chizuru.sales</a></p>
